OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 4 APR
OL,4,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,5,     GA dreamlike tale of love and
OL,6,     Gfate, wrapped in Debussy's
OL,7,     Ghypnotic harmonies. This
OL,8,     Gperformance with the BBC Scottish
OL,9,     GSymphony Orchestra brings
OL,10,     GDebussy's astonishing score to
OL,11,     Glife.
OL,12,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,13,     GLopa Kothari curates a selection
OL,14,     Gof roots-based music from across
OL,15,     Gthe globe, including highlights
OL,16,     Gfrom a recent London concert
OL,17,     Gappearance from Mongolian
OL,18,     Gensemble Anda Union.
